<description>&lt;p&gt;Local actors are seeking solutions to ongoing violence, with Uror communities pursuing local conflict resolution, clan elders meeting over boundary disputes, and the Troika calling for justice in Kajo-Keji. Political dynamics shifted as Machar confirmed Regina Joseph Kaba as acting SPLM-IO chair and the Dawn chief editor entered the SPLM race for the Tonj North parliamentary seat. Violence persists with an army captain and a civilian killed in cattle-raid clashes in Abyei, one person killed and three injured near the South Sudan-Uganda border, and continued clashes in Malakal, while Sudan General Al-Atta accused Puntland mercenaries of fighting alongside RSF. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOdi1scVlPVnVHWGI5eXN4VDd3Um1NYlFKeXlRODNsYW5zeWlJV3lNc1R0UEstX0JTQU5SbmlIOXNIX0kyUVo2Zm0tVVdxMUJBV3hFbEoxOWRnZ09GeExiUVNLZ2pzRzJaS3BqZlZLRXdnRGtiQWxmYWZKVUdBQUc2WXdlNjBVNjlqd2NEZFRwRk5lT3l5bExxSEcwRFYzQ09TZUJlM0V4V2h5YVlVS3R6bEh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVHBCM1FHNk1EZ2ViR1pBOVZ1RS1uY0pIVV9lOHFKbVBRMkFCTzdSdGc5X00xY1FOMm82MFpjMWwyek95OWc0enE0MHcyTTdXQ0NFTElwWi1HdTIxQk5uNkZsSTEwTlluZ044TVB0VE5SQlZDcjBDVVk3aDZpWEVGY0VYQWtjWGlya3JYRHlBMjRHTU5ON0N3dVVhVlNZbm9Na2xF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQblNhOFlJUng2dVo4RzZBR2tjdGRUaXZmUEJteU13NE9TUjNOdk5hVjlMcmhRWXZ0VWZOZzVCMVNoY2tZLXpFR2FndUUtSm1RUnBvZ3ZrNTkwTGlkTWlqZVdrc1VaZ1VmS21PNGZZaWlRMjZCbXYxbUVxMThra3JIX1hqWG12VkFnTWhmRmNMb1l4VDlsZ0lN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt